tasks.answer_format:
@correlation_coefficient[r_value]
@p_value[p_value]
@relationship_type[relationship_type]
where "r_value" is a number between -1 and 1, rounded to two decimal places.
where "p_value" is a number between 0 and 1, rounded to four decimal places.
where "relationship_type" is a string that can either be "linear", "nonlinear", or "none" based on the conditions specified in the constraints.

@mean_wind_pre[mean_wind_pre]
@mean_atmos_temp_pre[mean_atmos_temp_pre]
@mean_wind_post[mean_wind_post]
@mean_atmos_temp_post[mean_atmos_temp_post]
where "mean_wind_pre" and "mean_wind_post" are the mean wind speed values before and after preprocessing, rounded to two decimal places.
where "mean_atmos_temp_pre" and "mean_atmos_temp_post" are the mean atmospheric temperature values before and after preprocessing, rounded to two decimal places.
